# Programmatically generated De Almeida Qs

section5_en = [{'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'On which exact date did the decisive Battle of Diu take place in 1509?', 'opts': ['February 3, 1509', 'March 25, 1508', 'December 10, 1509', 'January 1, 1510'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'The Battle of Diu was fought on February 3, 1509 CE.'}, {'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'Who personally commanded the Portuguese fleet at the Battle of Diu?', 'opts': ['Francisco de Almeida', 'Lourenço de Almeida', 'Afonso de Albuquerque', 'Vasco da Gama'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': "The Viceroy Francisco de Almeida personally led the fleet to avenge his son's death."}, {'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'Which empire joined the Mamluks and Gujaratis by providing soldiers and gunners at Diu?', 'opts': ['The Ottoman Empire', 'The Safavid Empire', 'The Mughal Empire', 'The Vijayanagara Empire'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'The Ottoman Empire supported the coalition by sending gunners and military advisers.'}, {'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'What was the strategic outcome of the Battle of Diu for European history?', 'opts': ['It established European naval dominance in the Indian Ocean for nearly 400 years', 'It led to the complete expulsion of the Portuguese from India', 'It resulted in a stalemate', 'It forced the Portuguese to pay tribute to the Mughal Emperor'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'The victory secured Portuguese naval monopoly and paved the way for centuries of European dominance.'}, {'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'Where did Francisco de Almeida die in 1510 CE during his return journey to Portugal?', 'opts': ['Table Bay near the Cape of Good Hope', 'Lisbon harbor', 'Cochin port', 'Diu Island'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Almeida was killed in a skirmish with local Khoikhoi (Hottentots) at Table Bay (South Africa) in March 1510.'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': 'Which fleets and forces composed the defeated coalition at Diu in 1509? (Select all that apply)', 'opts': ['The Mamluk Sultanate fleet under Amir Husain', 'The Gujarat Sultanate fleet under Malik Ayyaz', 'Ottoman gunners and soldiers', 'The Portuguese navy under Albuquerque'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'The coalition consisted of Mamluks, Gujaratis, and Ottomans. The Portuguese were the victors, not part of the defeated coalition.'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': 'Identify the terms of surrender accepted by Malik Ayyaz after the Battle of Diu. (Select all that apply)', 'opts': ['Release of all Portuguese prisoners captured at Chaul', 'Payment of a heavy financial indemnity', 'Permission for the Portuguese to trade at Diu', 'Immediate handover of Diu fortress to the Portuguese'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'Ayyaz released the prisoners, paid an indemnity, and granted trade rights. The fort was not handed over until 1535.'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': 'Which tactical advantages favored the Portuguese at the Battle of Diu? (Select all that apply)', 'opts': ['Superior naval gunnery and larger cannon range', 'High-walled naus that were difficult to board', 'Coordinated division of ships by Almeida', 'The surprise intervention of a Spanish armada'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': "Superior gunnery, high-walled ships, and Almeida's coordination were key. No Spanish ships participated."}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': 'What were the geopolitical consequences of the Battle of Diu? (Select all that apply)', 'opts': ['Establishment of Portuguese naval hegemony in the Indian Ocean', 'Decline and eventual annexation of the Mamluk Sultanate by the Ottomans', 'Venice lost its status as the chief spice importer in Europe', 'The Mughal Empire conquered Gujarat immediately'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'Portuguese hegemony, the weakening of Mamluks (conquered by Ottomans in 1517), and Venetian decline were major consequences. The Mughals did not conquer Gujarat until 1573.'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': 'Which facts describe the death of Francisco de Almeida in 1510? (Select all that apply)', 'opts': ['It occurred at Table Bay, South Africa', 'He was killed in a skirmish with local Khoikhoi natives', 'He was buried in an unmarked grave on the beach', "He was assassinated by Afonso de Albuquerque's agents"], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'He died at Table Bay in a skirmish with Khoikhoi, and was buried there. He was not assassinated by Albuquerque.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'The Battle of Diu in 1509 was a decisive victory for the Mamluk Sultanate.', 'ans': False, 'sol': 'It was a decisive Portuguese victory that destroyed the Mamluk fleet.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'Almeida treated the defeated Mamluk prisoners at Diu with extreme brutality.', 'ans': True, 'sol': "He executed many prisoners in retaliatory revenge for his son's death."}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'The Ottoman Empire officially participated in the Battle of Diu by sending troops.', 'ans': True, 'sol': 'Ottoman soldiers and gunners reinforced the coalition fleet.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'Following his victory at Diu, Almeida immediately surrendered power to Albuquerque.', 'ans': True, 'sol': 'Having avenged his son, Almeida handed over governance in late 1509 and set sail for Portugal.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'Almeida was killed by a poison arrow shot by a Mamluk soldier in 1510.', 'ans': False, 'sol': 'He was killed by Khoikhoi spear/stone attacks during a skirmish over fresh water.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'The Battle of Diu ended Venetian control of the spice routes permanently.', 'ans': True, 'sol': 'It consolidated the Portuguese Cape Route monopoly, bypassing Venice.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'Malik Ayyaz was executed by Almeida after the battle.', 'ans': False, 'sol': 'Ayyaz surrendered and negotiated a peace treaty; he remained governor of Diu.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'The victory at Diu allowed the Portuguese to build their first fort in Diu immediately in 1509.', 'ans': False, 'sol': 'They were not allowed to build a fort in Diu until 1535.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The Battle of Diu was fought off the coast of __________ in Gujarat.', 'ans': 'Diu', 'sol': 'The battle took place off the island of Diu.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'Almeida personally led the fleet at Diu to avenge the death of his son __________.', 'ans': 'Lourenço', 'sol': 'Lourenço had been killed at Chaul in 1508.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The coalition fleet at Diu was co-commanded by Amir __________ of Egypt.', 'ans': 'Husain', 'sol': 'Amir Husain Al-Kurdi co-commanded the fleet.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'Viceroy Almeida died at Table Bay in South Africa after a skirmish with the local __________ tribe.', 'ans': 'Khoikhoi', 'sol': 'He died in a clash with the Khoikhoi (Hottentots).'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The Battle of Diu secured Portuguese naval dominance in the __________ Ocean.', 'ans': 'Indian', 'sol': 'It secured dominance in the Indian Ocean.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The year of the Battle of Diu was __________ CE.', 'ans': '1509', 'sol': 'The battle was fought on February 3, 1509 CE.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'Malik Ayyaz was the governor of __________ under the Gujarat Sultanate.', 'ans': 'Diu', 'sol': 'He governed Diu from his fortified island base.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The Ottoman sultan who supported the coalition fleet at Diu was Bayezid __________.', 'ans': 'II', 'sol': 'Sultan Bayezid II provided naval and military support.'}, {'type': 'Match the Following', 'q': "Match the historic locations with their roles in Almeida's final years:", 'items': [{'left': 'Diu coast'}, {'left': 'Cochin court'}, {'left': 'Table Bay'}], 'options': [{'val': '0', 'text': 'Site of the 1509 naval victory'}, {'val': '1', 'text': 'Place of power transition to Albuquerque'}, {'val': '2', 'text': "Location of Almeida's death in 1510"}], 'sol': 'Diu was the battle site, Cochin the power handover place, and Table Bay where he died.'}, {'type': 'Match the Following', 'q': 'Match the coalition participants of Diu with their contributions:', 'items': [{'left': 'Mamluk Sultanate'}, {'left': 'Ottoman Empire'}, {'left': 'Gujarat Sultanate'}], 'options': [{'val': '0', 'text': 'Core war fleet under Amir Husain'}, {'val': '1', 'text': 'Gunners and military specialists'}, {'val': '2', 'text': 'Local naval base and dhows under Malik Ayyaz'}], 'sol': 'Mamluks provided the core fleet, Ottomans the gunners, and Gujarat the local base.'}, {'type': 'Match the Following', 'q': 'Match the strategic outcomes of Diu with their long-term historical impacts:', 'items': [{'left': 'Destruction of Mamluk navy'}, {'left': 'Decline of Venice trade'}, {'left': 'Rise of Portuguese Cartaz'}], 'options': [{'val': '0', 'text': 'Ottoman annexation of Egypt in 1517'}, {'val': '1', 'text': 'Shift of spice center to Lisbon'}, {'val': '2', 'text': 'Enforced Mare Clausum in Indian Ocean'}], 'sol': 'Mamluk defeat led to Ottoman takeover, Venice decline shifted trade to Lisbon, and Cartaz enforced Mare Clausum.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'What was the primary motive of Almeida at the Battle of Diu?', 'sol': "Answer: To avenge the death of his son Lourenço. Explanation: Almeida was driven by personal revenge for his son's death at Chaul."}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'Who was the Ottoman commander who supported the Mamluks at Diu?', 'sol': "Answer: Selim I's representatives / local commanders. Explanation: Ottoman specialists supported the coalition."}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'In what year did the Ottoman Empire annex Egypt, partly due to Mamluk naval decline?', 'sol': 'Answer: 1517 CE. Explanation: The Mamluks were conquered by the Ottomans in 1517.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'Why did the Khoikhoi attack Almeida at Table Bay?', 'sol': 'Answer: Due to a dispute over cattle and fresh water. Explanation: A skirmish broke out during a water-stopover.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'Where was Francisco de Almeida buried?', 'sol': 'Answer: At Table Bay, South Africa. Explanation: He was buried in an unmarked grave on the shore.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'Did Almeida live to see Portugal receive the spice cargo from Diu?', 'sol': 'Answer: No, he died on the return journey. Explanation: He died off South Africa before reaching Lisbon.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'What did the Battle of Diu establish in terms of global maritime history?', 'sol': 'Answer: Four centuries of European naval dominance in Asia. Explanation: It began the era of European maritime empires in the East.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'How did Malik Ayyaz survive the Battle of Diu?', 'sol': 'Answer: By surrendering, releasing prisoners, and paying tribute to Almeida. Explanation: He negotiated peace before his base was destroyed.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'Assertion: The Battle of Diu is considered one of the most important naval battles in history.\nReason: It secured European naval dominance in the Indian Ocean for nearly four centuries.', 'opts': ['Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A', 'Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A', 'A is true but R is false', 'A is false but R is true'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'The victory established the Portuguese monopoly and set the stage for European colonial dominance.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': "Assertion: Almeida executed many coalition prisoners after the Battle of Diu.\nReason: He was driven by intense grief and a desire for revenge for his son's death at Chaul.", 'opts': ['Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A', 'Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A', 'A is true but R is false', 'A is false but R is true'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': "His retaliatory brutality was a direct response to Lourenço's death."}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'Assertion: The Ottoman Empire fought alongside the Mamluks at Diu.\nReason: The Ottomans wanted to protect their spice monopoly from Portuguese interference.', 'opts': ['Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A', 'Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A', 'A is true but R is false', 'A is false but R is true'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'The Ottomans supported the coalition to block Portuguese expansion into the Red Sea.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': "Assertion: Almeida was assassinated by Afonso de Albuquerque's agents at Table Bay.\nReason: Albuquerque wanted to prevent Almeida from returning to Lisbon and revealing his strategic errors.", 'opts': ['Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A', 'Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A', 'A is true but R is false', 'A is false but R is true'], 'ans': 3, 'sol': 'Both are false. Almeida died in a skirmish with the Khoikhoi, not by assassination.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'Assertion: Malik Ayyaz surrendered Diu to the Portuguese in 1509.\nReason: The Portuguese fleet completely destroyed the city and fort of Diu during the battle.', 'opts': ['Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A', 'Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A', 'A is true but R is false', 'A is false but R is true'], 'ans': 3, 'sol': 'Both are false. Ayyaz did not surrender the city/fort; he only released prisoners and paid tribute.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'Assertion: The Mamluk Sultanate was severely weakened by the Battle of Diu.\nReason: The loss of their navy depleted their treasury and left them vulnerable to Ottoman conquest in 1517.', 'opts': ['Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A', 'Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A', 'A is true but R is false', 'A is false but R is true'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Naval defeats and loss of spice revenue contributed to the Mamluk collapse.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': "Assertion: Almeida's death at Table Bay was a major embarrassment for the Portuguese Crown.\nReason: A distinguished Viceroy and military hero was killed in a simple skirmish with lightly armed African natives.", 'opts': ['Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A', 'Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A', 'A is true but R is false', 'A is false but R is true'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'His death in a minor clash shocked the Portuguese court.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'Assertion: The Battle of Diu ended the Levant spice route permanently.\nReason: The victory allowed the Portuguese to block all shipping through the Red Sea and Persian Gulf.', 'opts': ['Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A', 'Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A', 'A is true but R is false', 'A is false but R is true'], 'ans': 2, 'sol': 'Assertion is true (it severely disrupted Levantine trade), but Reason is false because they could never fully block all shipping, and smuggling continued.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'Consider the following statements regarding the Battle of Diu:\n1. It was fought in 1509 CE off the coast of Gujarat.\n2. The Portuguese fleet defeated a combined Mamluk-Ottoman-Gujarati fleet.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['1 only', '2 only', 'Both 1 and 2', 'Neither 1 nor 2'], 'ans': 2, 'sol': 'Both statements are correct. The battle occurred in 1509 and defeated the combined Muslim coalition.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'Consider the following statements about the death of Francisco de Almeida:\n1. He died in 1510 CE at Table Bay, South Africa.\n2. He was killed in a battle against the Ottoman Empire.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['1 only', '2 only', 'Both 1 and 2', 'Neither 1 nor 2'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Statement 1 is correct. Statement 2 is incorrect; he was killed in a skirmish with local Khoikhoi natives.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'With reference to the aftermath of the Battle of Diu, consider these statements:\n1. Malik Ayyaz surrendered and returned Portuguese prisoners.\n2. Afonso de Albuquerque took over as the second Governor of India.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['1 only', '2 only', 'Both 1 and 2', 'Neither 1 nor 2'], 'ans': 2, 'sol': 'Both statements are correct. Prisoners were released, and Albuquerque assumed governance in late 1509.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'Consider the statements about the long-term impact of the Battle of Diu:\n1. It marked the beginning of European dominance in Asian seas.\n2. It led to the immediate creation of the British East India Company.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['1 only', '2 only', 'Both 1 and 2', 'Neither 1 nor 2'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Statement 1 is correct. The British East India Company was formed much later, in 1600 CE.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'With reference to Ottoman participation at Diu, consider these statements:\n1. The Ottomans provided gunners and soldiers to support the Mamluks.\n2. The Ottoman fleet was commanded by Sultan Selim I in person.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['1 only', '2 only', 'Both 1 and 2', 'Neither 1 nor 2'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Statement 1 is correct. Statement 2 is incorrect; the Sultan did not travel to India.'}, {'type': 'Why', 'q': 'Why did Viceroy Almeida refuse to return to Portugal immediately after the Battle of Chaul?', 'sol': "He wanted to seek revenge for his son Lourenço's death and destroy the Mamluk fleet before handing over power to Albuquerque."}, {'type': 'Why', 'q': 'Why was the Battle of Diu a critical turning point in global trade history?', 'sol': 'It shattered the Arab-Mamluk control of the spice routes, consolidating the Portuguese Cape Route monopoly and shifting trade centers to Lisbon.'}, {'type': 'Why', 'q': 'Why did a minor skirmish at Table Bay result in the death of a highly experienced commander like Almeida?', 'sol': 'The Portuguese were unarmored, lacked coordination, and were caught off guard by the rapid stone and spear throwing of the Khoikhoi.'}, {'type': 'How', 'q': 'How did the Ottoman Empire support the coalition against the Portuguese at Diu?', 'sol': 'They supplied experienced gunners, soldiers, and military advisors to reinforce the Mamluk and Gujarati forces.'}, {'type': 'How', 'q': 'How did the victory at Diu influence the subsequent expansion strategy of Albuquerque?', 'sol': 'It cleared the seas of major enemy fleets, allowing Albuquerque to focus on capturing key land bases like Goa, Malacca, and Aden.'}, {'type': 'How', 'q': 'How did Malik Ayyaz negotiate the peace terms with Almeida after the battle?', 'sol': 'He acted pragmatically, offering to return all prisoners and pay a large financial indemnity, while retaining control of Diu.'}, {'type': 'Case Study', 'q': 'Analyze the tactical differences in gunnery that decided the outcome of the Battle of Diu.', 'sol': 'The Portuguese naus used heavy, long-range naval artillery that decimated the coalition dhows before they could close in for boarding.'}, {'type': 'Case Study', 'q': 'Examine the geopolitical decline of Egypt and Venice as a consequence of the Battle of Diu.', 'sol': 'The loss of spice revenues weakened the Mamluk economy, leading to its Ottoman annexation, while Venice lost its position as the chief spice supplier to Europe.'}, {'type': 'Case Study', 'q': 'Evaluate the leadership legacy of Francisco de Almeida compared to Afonso de Albuquerque.', 'sol': 'Almeida focused on naval hegemony and commercial safety, while Albuquerque pursued territorial expansion and permanent land colonization.'}, {'type': 'Teach the Concept', 'q': "Explain the concept of 'Viceroyal Revenge' as seen in the Battle of Diu.", 'sol': "It refers to the campaign where Almeida used the state's military resources to launch a retaliatory strike to avenge his son's death at Chaul."}, {'type': 'Teach the Concept', 'q': 'Describe the naval formation used by the Portuguese fleet at Diu.', 'sol': 'Almeida organized his ships into a tight line-of-battle, utilizing naval broadsides to destroy enemy vessels in the Diu harbor channel.'}, {'type': 'Teach the Concept', 'q': "Explain why the Battle of Diu is considered the beginning of the 'Vasco da Gama Era'.", 'sol': 'It established European naval supremacy in Asia, starting a 400-year period where European empires dominated Asian trade and politics.'}]

section5_hi = [{'type': 'MCQ', 'q': '1509 में निर्णायक दीव की लड़ाई किस सटीक तारीख को हुई थी?', 'opts': ['3 फरवरी, 1509', '25 मार्च, 1508', '10 दिसंबर, 1509', '1 जनवरी, 1510'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'दीव की लड़ाई 3 फरवरी, 1509 ईस्वी को लड़ी गई थी।'}, {'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'दीव की लड़ाई में पुर्तगाली बेड़े की कमान व्यक्तिगत रूप से किसने संभाली थी?', 'opts': ['फ्रांसिस्को डी अल्मेडा', 'लॉरेंको डी अल्मेडा', 'अल्फांसो डी अल्बुकर्क', 'वास्को डी गामा'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'वायसराय फ्रांसिस्को डी अल्मेडा ने अपने बेटे की मौत का बदला लेने के लिए व्यक्तिगत रूप से बेड़े का नेतृत्व किया था।'}, {'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'दीव में सैनिकों और तोपचियों को प्रदान करके कौन सा साम्राज्य ममलुकों और गुजरातियों के साथ शामिल हुआ था?', 'opts': ['ओटोमन साम्राज्य', 'सफाविद साम्राज्य', 'मुगल साम्राज्य', 'विजयनगर साम्राज्य'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'ओटोमन साम्राज्य ने तोपचियों और सैन्य सलाहकारों को भेजकर गठबंधन का समर्थन किया था।'}, {'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'यूरोपीय इतिहास के लिए दीव की लड़ाई का रणनीतिक परिणाम क्या था?', 'opts': ['इसने लगभग 400 वर्षों तक हिंद महासागर में यूरोपीय नौसैनिक प्रभुत्व स्थापित किया', 'इसके कारण भारत से पुर्तगालियों का पूर्ण निष्कासन हुआ', 'इसके परिणामस्वरूप गतिरोध पैदा हुआ', 'इसने पुर्तगालियों को मुगल सम्राट को कर देने के लिए मजबूर किया'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'इस जीत ने पुर्तगाली नौसैनिक एकाधिकार को सुरक्षित किया और सदियों के यूरोपीय वर्चस्व का मार्ग प्रशस्त किया।'}, {'type': 'MCQ', 'q': 'पुर्तगाल की अपनी वापसी यात्रा के दौरान 1510 ईस्वी में फ्रांसिस्को डी अल्मेडा की मृत्यु कहाँ हुई थी?', 'opts': ['केप ऑफ गुड होप के पास टेबल बे (Table Bay)', 'लिस्बन बंदरगाह', 'कोचीन बंदरगाह', 'दीव द्वीप'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'अल्मेडा मार्च 1510 में टेबल बे (दक्षिण अफ्रीका) में स्थानीय खोइखोई (Khoikhoi) के साथ एक झड़प में मारे गए थे।'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': '1509 में दीव में पराजित गठबंधन में कौन से बेड़े और बल शामिल थे? (सभी लागू विकल्प चुनें)', 'opts': ['अमीर हुसैन के तहत ममलुक सल्तनत का बेड़ा', 'मलिक अय्याज़ के तहत गुजरात सल्तनत का बेड़ा', 'ओटोमन तोपची और सैनिक', 'अल्बुकर्क के तहत पुर्तगाली नौसेना'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'गठबंधन में ममलुक, गुजराती और ओटोमन शामिल थे। पुर्तगाली विजेता थे, न कि पराजित गठबंधन का हिस्सा।'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': 'दीव की लड़ाई के बाद मलिक अय्याज़ द्वारा स्वीकार की गई आत्मसमर्पण की शर्तों की पहचान करें: (सभी लागू विकल्प चुनें)', 'opts': ['चोल में पकड़े गए सभी पुर्तगाली कैदियों की रिहाई', 'भारी वित्तीय क्षतिपूर्ति का भुगतान', 'पुर्तगालियों को दीव में व्यापार करने की अनुमति', 'पुर्तगालियों को दीव किले का तत्काल हस्तांतरण'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'अय्याज़ ने कैदियों को रिहा किया, क्षतिपूर्ति का भुगतान किया और व्यापारिक अधिकार दिए। किले का हस्तांतरण 1535 तक नहीं हुआ था।'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': 'दीव की लड़ाई में पुर्तगालियों के लिए कौन से रणनीतिक लाभ सहायक थे? (सभी लागू विकल्प चुनें)', 'opts': ['बेहतर नौसैनिक तोपखाना और बड़ी तोप सीमा', 'ऊंची दीवारों वाले जहाज जिन पर चढ़ना मुश्किल था', 'अल्मेडा द्वारा जहाजों का समन्वित विभाजन', 'एक स्पेनिश बेड़े का अचानक हस्तक्षेप'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'बेहतर तोपें, ऊंचे जहाज और अल्मेडा का समन्वय प्रमुख थे। किसी भी स्पेनिश जहाज ने भाग नहीं लिया।'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': 'दीव की लड़ाई के भू-राजनीतिक परिणाम क्या थे? (सभी लागू विकल्प चुनें)', 'opts': ['हिंद महासागर में पुर्तगाली नौसैनिक वर्चस्व की स्थापना', 'ओटोमन्स द्वारा ममलुक सल्तनत का पतन और अंततः विलय', 'वेनिस ने यूरोप में मुख्य मसाला आयातक के रूप में अपना स्थान खो दिया', 'मुगल साम्राज्य ने गुजरात पर तुरंत विजय प्राप्त की'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'पुर्तगाली वर्चस्व, ममलुकों का पतन और वेनिस का पतन इसके प्रमुख परिणाम थे। मुगलों ने 1573 तक गुजरात पर विजय नहीं प्राप्त की थी।'}, {'type': 'Multiple Correct MCQ', 'q': '1510 में फ्रांसिस्को डी अल्मेडा की मृत्यु का वर्णन करने वाले तथ्यों का चयन करें: (सभी लागू विकल्प चुनें)', 'opts': ['यह टेबल बे, दक्षिण अफ्रीका में हुआ था', 'वह स्थानीय खोइखोई आदिवासियों के साथ एक झड़प में मारे गए थे', 'उन्हें समुद्र तट पर एक अचिह्नित कब्र में दफनाया गया था', 'अल्फांसो डी अल्बुकर्क के एजेंटों द्वारा उनकी हत्या कर दी गई थी'], 'ans': [0, 1, 2], 'sol': 'टेबल बे में खोइखोई के साथ झड़प में उनकी मृत्यु हुई, और उन्हें वहीं दफनाया गया। अल्बुकर्क ने उनकी हत्या नहीं करवाई थी।'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'The Battle of Diu in 1509 was a decisive victory for the ममलुक Sultanate.', 'ans': False, 'sol': 'It was a decisive Portuguese victory that destroyed the Mamluk fleet.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'अल्मेडा treated the defeated ममलुक prisoners at Diu with extreme brutality.', 'ans': True, 'sol': "He executed many prisoners in retaliatory revenge for his son's death."}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'The Ottoman Empire officially participated in the Battle of Diu by sending troops.', 'ans': True, 'sol': 'Ottoman soldiers and gunners reinforced the coalition fleet.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'Following his victory at Diu, अल्मेडा immediately surrendered power to अल्बुकर्क.', 'ans': True, 'sol': 'Having avenged his son, अल्मेडा handed over governance in late 1509 and set sail for Portugal.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'अल्मेडा was killed by a poison arrow shot by a ममलुक soldier in 1510.', 'ans': False, 'sol': 'He was killed by Khoikhoi spear/stone attacks during a skirmish over fresh water.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'The Battle of Diu ended Venetian control of the spice routes permanently.', 'ans': True, 'sol': 'It consolidated the Portuguese Cape Route monopoly, bypassing Venice.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'Malik Ayyaz was executed by अल्मेडा after the battle.', 'ans': False, 'sol': 'Ayyaz surrendered and negotiated a peace treaty; he remained governor of Diu.'}, {'type': 'True/False', 'q': 'The victory at Diu allowed the Portuguese to build their first fort in Diu immediately in 1509.', 'ans': False, 'sol': 'They were not allowed to build a fort in Diu until 1535.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The Battle of Diu was fought off the coast of __________ in Gujarat.', 'ans': 'Diu', 'sol': 'The battle took place off the island of Diu.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'अल्मेडा personally led the fleet at Diu to avenge the death of his son __________.', 'ans': 'Lourenço', 'sol': 'Lourenço had been killed at Chaul in 1508.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The coalition fleet at Diu was co-commanded by Amir __________ of Egypt.', 'ans': 'Husain', 'sol': 'Amir Husain Al-Kurdi co-commanded the fleet.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'Viceroy अल्मेडा died at Table Bay in South Africa after a skirmish with the local __________ tribe.', 'ans': 'Khoikhoi', 'sol': 'He died in a clash with the Khoikhoi (Hottentots).'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The Battle of Diu secured Portuguese naval dominance in the __________ Ocean.', 'ans': 'Indian', 'sol': 'It secured dominance in the Indian Ocean.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The year of the Battle of Diu was __________ CE.', 'ans': '1509', 'sol': 'The battle was fought on February 3, 1509 CE.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'Malik Ayyaz was the governor of __________ under the Gujarat Sultanate.', 'ans': 'Diu', 'sol': 'He governed Diu from his fortified island base.'}, {'type': 'Fill in the Blank', 'q': 'The Ottoman sultan who supported the coalition fleet at Diu was Bayezid __________.', 'ans': 'II', 'sol': 'Sultan Bayezid II provided naval and military support.'}, {'type': 'Match the Following', 'q': 'अल्मेडा के अंतिम वर्षों में उनकी भूमिकाओं के साथ ऐतिहासिक स्थानों का मिलान करें:', 'items': [{'left': 'दीव तट'}, {'left': 'कोचीन दरबार'}, {'left': 'टेबल बे'}], 'options': [{'val': '0', 'text': '1509 की नौसैनिक विजय का स्थल'}, {'val': '1', 'text': 'अल्बुकर्क को सत्ता हस्तांतरण का स्थान'}, {'val': '2', 'text': '1510 में अल्मेडा की मृत्यु का स्थान'}], 'sol': 'दीव युद्ध स्थल था, कोचीन सत्ता हस्तांतरण स्थल था, और टेबल बे में उनकी मृत्यु हुई थी।'}, {'type': 'Match the Following', 'q': 'दीव के गठबंधन प्रतिभागियों का उनके योगदान से मिलान करें:', 'items': [{'left': 'ममलुक सल्तनत'}, {'left': 'ओटोमन साम्राज्य'}, {'left': 'गुजरात सल्तनत'}], 'options': [{'val': '0', 'text': 'अमीर हुसैन के तहत मुख्य युद्धक बेड़ा'}, {'val': '1', 'text': 'तोपची और सैन्य विशेषज्ञ'}, {'val': '2', 'text': 'मलिक अय्याज़ के तहत स्थानीय नौसैनिक अड्डा और जहाज'}], 'sol': 'ममलुकों ने मुख्य बेड़ा, ओटोमन्स ने तोपची, और गुजरात ने स्थानीय आधार प्रदान किया।'}, {'type': 'Match the Following', 'q': 'दीव के रणनीतिक परिणामों का उनके दीर्घकालिक ऐतिहासिक प्रभावों से मिलान करें:', 'items': [{'left': 'ममलुक नौसेना का विनाश'}, {'left': 'वेनिस व्यापार का पतन'}, {'left': 'पुर्तगाली कार्टाज का उदय'}], 'options': [{'val': '0', 'text': '1517 में मिस्र पर ओटोमन का कब्जा'}, {'val': '1', 'text': 'मसाला केंद्र का लिस्बन में स्थानांतरण'}, {'val': '2', 'text': 'हिंद महासागर में मारे क्लॉसम लागू करना'}], 'sol': 'ममलुक हार से ओटोमन कब्जा हुआ, वेनिस पतन से लिस्बन व्यापार बढ़ा, और कार्टाज से मारे क्लॉसम लागू हुआ।'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'What was the primary motive of अल्मेडा at the Battle of Diu?', 'sol': "उत्तर: To avenge the death of his son Lourenço.। स्पष्टीकरण: अल्मेडा was driven by personal revenge for his son's death at Chaul."}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'Who was the Ottoman commander who supported the Mamluks at Diu?', 'sol': "उत्तर: Selim I's representatives / local commanders.। स्पष्टीकरण: Ottoman specialists supported the coalition."}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'In what year did the Ottoman Empire annex Egypt, partly due to Mamluk naval decline?', 'sol': 'उत्तर: 1517 CE.। स्पष्टीकरण: The Mamluks were conquered by the Ottomans in 1517.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'Why did the Khoikhoi attack अल्मेडा at टेबल बे?', 'sol': 'उत्तर: Due to a dispute over cattle and fresh water.। स्पष्टीकरण: A skirmish broke out during a water-stopover.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'Where was Francisco de अल्मेडा buried?', 'sol': 'उत्तर: At टेबल बे, South Africa.। स्पष्टीकरण: He was buried in an unmarked grave on the shore.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'Did अल्मेडा live to see Portugal receive the spice cargo from Diu?', 'sol': 'उत्तर: No, he died on the return journey.। स्पष्टीकरण: He died off South Africa before reaching Lisbon.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'What did the Battle of Diu establish in terms of global maritime history?', 'sol': 'उत्तर: Four centuries of European naval dominance in Asia.। स्पष्टीकरण: It began the era of European maritime empires in the East.'}, {'type': 'One-Liner', 'q': 'How did Malik Ayyaz survive the Battle of Diu?', 'sol': 'उत्तर: By surrendering, releasing prisoners, and paying tribute to अल्मेडा.। स्पष्टीकरण: He negotiated peace before his base was destroyed.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'अभिकथन: The Battle of Diu is considered one of the most important naval battles in history.\nकारण: It secured European naval dominance in the Indian Ocean for nearly four centuries.', 'opts': ['A और R दोनों सही हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है', 'A और R दोनों सही हैं लेकिन R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं करता है', 'A सही है लेकिन R गलत है', 'A गलत है लेकिन R सही है'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'The victory established the Portuguese monopoly and set the stage for European colonial dominance.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': "अभिकथन: अल्मेडा executed many coalition prisoners after the Battle of Diu.\nकारण: He was driven by intense grief and a desire for revenge for his son's death at Chaul.", 'opts': ['A और R दोनों सही हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है', 'A और R दोनों सही हैं लेकिन R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं करता है', 'A सही है लेकिन R गलत है', 'A गलत है लेकिन R सही है'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': "His retaliatory brutality was a direct response to Lourenço's death."}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'अभिकथन: The Ottoman Empire fought alongside the Mamluks at Diu.\nकारण: The Ottomans wanted to protect their spice monopoly from Portuguese interference.', 'opts': ['A और R दोनों सही हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है', 'A और R दोनों सही हैं लेकिन R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं करता है', 'A सही है लेकिन R गलत है', 'A गलत है लेकिन R सही है'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'The Ottomans supported the coalition to block Portuguese expansion into the Red Sea.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': "अभिकथन: अल्मेडा was assassinated by Afonso de Albuquerque's agents at Table Bay.\nकारण: Albuquerque wanted to prevent अल्मेडा from returning to Lisbon and revealing his strategic errors.", 'opts': ['A और R दोनों सही हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है', 'A और R दोनों सही हैं लेकिन R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं करता है', 'A सही है लेकिन R गलत है', 'A गलत है लेकिन R सही है'], 'ans': 3, 'sol': 'Both are false. अल्मेडा died in a skirmish with the Khoikhoi, not by assassination.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'अभिकथन: Malik Ayyaz surrendered Diu to the Portuguese in 1509.\nकारण: The Portuguese fleet completely destroyed the city and fort of Diu during the battle.', 'opts': ['A और R दोनों सही हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है', 'A और R दोनों सही हैं लेकिन R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं करता है', 'A सही है लेकिन R गलत है', 'A गलत है लेकिन R सही है'], 'ans': 3, 'sol': 'Both are false. Ayyaz did not surrender the city/fort; he only released prisoners and paid tribute.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'अभिकथन: The Mamluk Sultanate was severely weakened by the Battle of Diu.\nकारण: The loss of their navy depleted their treasury and left them vulnerable to Ottoman conquest in 1517.', 'opts': ['A और R दोनों सही हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है', 'A और R दोनों सही हैं लेकिन R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं करता है', 'A सही है लेकिन R गलत है', 'A गलत है लेकिन R सही है'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Naval defeats and loss of spice revenue contributed to the Mamluk collapse.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': "अभिकथन: अल्मेडा's death at Table Bay was a major embarrassment for the Portuguese Crown.\nकारण: A distinguished Viceroy and military hero was killed in a simple skirmish with lightly armed African natives.", 'opts': ['A और R दोनों सही हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है', 'A और R दोनों सही हैं लेकिन R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं करता है', 'A सही है लेकिन R गलत है', 'A गलत है लेकिन R सही है'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'His death in a minor clash shocked the Portuguese court.'}, {'type': 'Assertion-Reason', 'q': 'अभिकथन: The Battle of Diu ended the Levant spice route permanently.\nकारण: The victory allowed the Portuguese to block all shipping through the Red Sea and Persian Gulf.', 'opts': ['A और R दोनों सही हैं और R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है', 'A और R दोनों सही हैं लेकिन R, A की सही व्याख्या नहीं करता है', 'A सही है लेकिन R गलत है', 'A गलत है लेकिन R सही है'], 'ans': 2, 'sol': 'Assertion is true (it severely disrupted Levantine trade), but Reason is false because they could never fully block all shipping, and smuggling continued.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'Consider the following statements regarding the Battle of Diu:\n1. It was fought in 1509 CE off the coast of Gujarat.\n2. The Portuguese fleet defeated a combined Mamluk-ओटोमन-Gujarati fleet.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['केवल 1', 'केवल 2', '1 और 2 दोनों', 'न तो 1 न ही 2'], 'ans': 2, 'sol': 'Both statements are correct. The battle occurred in 1509 and defeated the combined Muslim coalition.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'Consider the following statements about the death of Francisco de अल्मेडा:\n1. He died in 1510 CE at Table Bay, South Africa.\n2. He was killed in a battle against the ओटोमन Empire.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['केवल 1', 'केवल 2', '1 और 2 दोनों', 'न तो 1 न ही 2'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Statement 1 is correct. Statement 2 is incorrect; he was killed in a skirmish with local Khoikhoi natives.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'With reference to the aftermath of the Battle of Diu, consider these statements:\n1. Malik Ayyaz surrendered and returned Portuguese prisoners.\n2. Afonso de Albuquerque took over as the second Governor of India.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['केवल 1', 'केवल 2', '1 और 2 दोनों', 'न तो 1 न ही 2'], 'ans': 2, 'sol': 'Both statements are correct. Prisoners were released, and Albuquerque assumed governance in late 1509.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'Consider the statements about the long-term impact of the Battle of Diu:\n1. It marked the beginning of European dominance in Asian seas.\n2. It led to the immediate creation of the British East India Company.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['केवल 1', 'केवल 2', '1 और 2 दोनों', 'न तो 1 न ही 2'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Statement 1 is correct. The British East India Company was formed much later, in 1600 CE.'}, {'type': 'Statement-Based', 'q': 'With reference to ओटोमन participation at Diu, consider these statements:\n1. The ओटोमनs provided gunners and soldiers to support the Mamluks.\n2. The ओटोमन fleet was commanded by Sultan Selim I in person.\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?', 'opts': ['केवल 1', 'केवल 2', '1 और 2 दोनों', 'न तो 1 न ही 2'], 'ans': 0, 'sol': 'Statement 1 is correct. Statement 2 is incorrect; the Sultan did not travel to India.'}, {'type': 'Why', 'q': 'Why did Viceroy अल्मेडा refuse to return to Portugal immediately after the Battle of Chaul?', 'sol': "He wanted to seek revenge for his son Lourenço's death and destroy the Mamluk fleet before handing over power to Albuquerque."}, {'type': 'Why', 'q': 'Why was the Battle of Diu a critical turning point in global trade history?', 'sol': 'It shattered the Arab-Mamluk control of the spice routes, consolidating the Portuguese Cape Route monopoly and shifting trade centers to Lisbon.'}, {'type': 'Why', 'q': 'Why did a minor skirmish at टेबल बे result in the death of a highly experienced commander like अल्मेडा?', 'sol': 'The Portuguese were unarmored, lacked coordination, and were caught off guard by the rapid stone and spear throwing of the Khoikhoi.'}, {'type': 'How', 'q': 'How did the Ottoman Empire support the coalition against the Portuguese at Diu?', 'sol': 'They supplied experienced gunners, soldiers, and military advisors to reinforce the Mamluk and Gujarati forces.'}, {'type': 'How', 'q': 'How did the victory at Diu influence the subsequent expansion strategy of Albuquerque?', 'sol': 'It cleared the seas of major enemy fleets, allowing Albuquerque to focus on capturing key land bases like Goa, Malacca, and Aden.'}, {'type': 'How', 'q': 'How did Malik Ayyaz negotiate the peace terms with अल्मेडा after the battle?', 'sol': 'He acted pragmatically, offering to return all prisoners and pay a large financial indemnity, while retaining control of Diu.'}, {'type': 'Case Study', 'q': 'Analyze the tactical differences in gunnery that decided the outcome of the Battle of Diu.', 'sol': 'The Portuguese naus used heavy, long-range naval artillery that decimated the coalition dhows before they could close in for boarding.'}, {'type': 'Case Study', 'q': 'Examine the geopolitical decline of Egypt and Venice as a consequence of the Battle of Diu.', 'sol': 'The loss of spice revenues weakened the Mamluk economy, leading to its Ottoman annexation, while Venice lost its position as the chief spice supplier to Europe.'}, {'type': 'Case Study', 'q': 'Evaluate the leadership legacy of Francisco de अल्मेडा compared to Afonso de Albuquerque.', 'sol': 'अल्मेडा focused on naval hegemony and commercial safety, while Albuquerque pursued territorial expansion and permanent land colonization.'}, {'type': 'Teach the Concept', 'q': "Explain the concept of 'Viceroyal Revenge' as seen in the Battle of Diu.", 'sol': "It refers to the campaign where अल्मेडा used the state's military resources to launch a retaliatory strike to avenge his son's death at Chaul."}, {'type': 'Teach the Concept', 'q': 'Describe the naval formation used by the Portuguese fleet at Diu.', 'sol': 'अल्मेडा organized his ships into a tight line-of-battle, utilizing naval broadsides to destroy enemy vessels in the Diu harbor channel.'}, {'type': 'Teach the Concept', 'q': "Explain why the Battle of Diu is considered the beginning of the 'Vasco da Gama Era'.", 'sol': 'It established European naval supremacy in Asia, starting a 400-year period where European empires dominated Asian trade and politics.'}]
